licy", "definition": "A formal statement of principles and requirements governing tree management.", "topic": "Urban forestry & tree management"}, {"term": "Tree population", "definition": "The collection of trees considered within a defined geographic, organisational or management boundary.", "topic": "Urban forestry & tree management"}, {"term": "Tree population structure", "definition": "The distribution of trees by age, size, species and condition within a population.", "topic": "Urban forestry & tree management"}, {"term": "Tree protection fencing", "definition": "Physical fencing used to delineate and protect a tree protection area during works.", "topic": "Development, construction & tree protection"}, {"term": "Tree protection inspection", "definition": "Inspection undertaken to verify that tree-protection measures are installed and maintained appropriately.", "topic": "Development, construction & tree protection"}, {"term": "Tree protection plan", "definition": "A plan showing trees, protection areas, construction interfaces and tree-protection measures.", "topic": "Development, construction & tree protection"}, {"term": "Tree protection plan (TPP)", "definition": "Under AS 4970:2025, a site plan showing trees to be retained, protection zones, fencing locations, construction interfaces and tree-protection measures.", "topic": "Development, construction & tree protection"}, {"term": "Tree protection schedule", "definition": "A tabulated schedule identifying trees, protection requirements, impacts and management actions.", "topic": "Development, construction & tree protection"}, {"term": "Tree protection specifications (TPS)", "definition": "Under AS 4970:2025, the written document detailing tree-protection instructions, work methods, hold points, mitigation measures, monitoring and compliance requirements for a development site.", "topic": "Development, construction & tree protection"}, {"term": "Tree protection zone (TPZ)", "definition": "Under AS 4970:2025